<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Flashing Grip</h1>
<p>Sphere: Mind Sphere
Class: Healer (guild level 115)
Mana: 44
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast flashing grip &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast flashing grip</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The mightiest of the colour spells: a grip of flashing colours closes on the 
target's mind. The better your power and mind sphere, the more it hurts. It 
does about as well against any armour, plate a little more, and a shield 
takes some of it, but can't stop it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It is also found on staffs, 
wands and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Flash</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Colourbeam</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Colourspray</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Mind Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>